Notes:                                                                                                                                           
* mean microcat depths: for AM02 dep, AM01 dep, AM03 dep and AM04 dep - instrument depths after mooring deployments                              
                        for AM02 1a, 1, 3, 4, 5 and 6  - mean over data time span                                                                    
                        for AM01 1a, 1b, 1, 2, 3, 5, 6 and 7 - mean over first couple of days of deployment in Jan. 2002                                  
                        for AM03 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 and 6      - mean over data time span                                                                    
                        for AM04 1a, 1, 2, 3, 4 and 5     - mean over data time span                                                                    
                        for AM04 4, cat1972 has mean pressure of 545.4 dbar before pressure step, 527.6 dbar after step, and 534.8 dbar for 
                          whole time series

                        for AM04 5, cat1972 mean pressure is for data from 04/03/2010-22/12/2010; for cat1973 and cat1974, mean pressure
                          is for the 2 years' of data; all mean pressures include the pressure steps

                        for AM05 deployment, pressures are 5 days after deployment

                        for AM05 1                        - mean over data time span, including pressure steps                                                                    
                        for AM05 2, cat7322 and 7326      - mean over data time span, including pressure steps                                                                    
                        for AM05 2, cat7327 pressure sensor data were bad. A single pressure value (estimated from previous season's
                          instrument positions) has been used

                        for AM05 3, cat7322 and 7326      - mean over data time span, including pressure steps                                                                    
                        for AM05 3, cat7327 pressure sensor data were bad. A single pressure value (from immediately after deployment)
                          has been used

                        for AM06 deployment, pressures are ~6 days after deployment
                        
                        for AM06 1 and 2                  - mean over data time span                                          

                        for AM06 3, cat7323 and 7324      - mean over data time span                                                                    
                        for AM06 3, cat7325 pressure sensor data were bad. A single pressure value (from immediately after deployment)
                          has been used
                                                                                                                                                 
* magnetic declinations are averages over data time spans (except for point values at initial mooring deployments, and "site visits" as indicated)                               
                                                                                                                                                 
* bottom depth (total water depth from water surface in borehole to ocean bottom) = 790 m at deployment time for AM02                            
                                                                                  = 783 m at deployment time for AM01                            
                                                                                  = 1265 m at deployment time for AM03                            
                                                                                  = 938 m at deployment time for AM04                            
                                                                                  = 909 m at deployment time for AM05                            
                                                                                  = 827 m 2 days before deployment time for AM06                            
                                                                                                                                                 
* positions marked with * are estimates from iceshelf velocity calculations, and should be considered mean positions for the relevant summers    
                                                                                                                                                 
